      "original_post_id": "83027"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "83065",
      "author_handle": "soup",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 16 years 10 months ago",
      "body": "when there is a good latch you wont get bit the time you have to look out for is when they pop off the breast - give you a cheeky look and then give you a nip.\ni think just saying no, prehapes pulling a sad face and then putting them down lets them know that it is not appreciated",
      "permalink": "https://www.justparents.co.uk/forums/topic-9017/#83065",
